# The embedded deck

A short deck that exists only to be pulled into `index.tmd` by a
`{{< embed talk.tmd >}}`. It is built beside the embedding page, not listed in
the site nav.

## A second slide

The iframe isolates this deck's full-viewport CSS, keyboard handling, and theme
sync from the host article.
